** Choices: {{p|Popplio}}, {{p|Litten}}, {{p|Rowlet}}, {{p|Sandygast}}
** Answer: Sandygast
* {{al|Anna}} and [[DJ Leo]] narrate the preview for the [[SM023|next episode]].
