===Errors===
* When Ash walks over to Sandygast to place {{an|Rotom Pokédex|Rotom}} on its head, {{TP|Kiawe|Turtonator}}'s spikes on his neck are colored red like his shell instead of green.
* When {{ashfr}} arrive on the beach, {{an|Lillie}} appears out of thin air when the camera pans.
* After Kiawe explains that Ash and {{AP|Litten}} are trapped inside {{p|Palossand}}, the spikes on {{TP|Sophocles|Togedemaru}} turn completely yellow.
** When {{an|Mallow}} starts using a leaf to blow [[Snowy]]'s {{m|Powder Snow}}, her spikes turn completely brown.
* In several scenes, Ash's [[Z-Ring]] is missing.
* When Ash attempts to throw Litten to his friends as {{an|Mallow}} explains that Palossand is using Litten and Rotom's energy to maintain its size, Ash has his [[bag]], despite not wearing it in previous shots.
* When Togedemaru uses her tail to blow Snowy's Powder Snow, her spikes have their colors reversed.
* After Kiawe turns around to look with confusion at Togedemaru, the five triangular scales above the mouth of Palossand are miscolored.
* When Ash attempts to run up to the window when {{AP|Rowlet}} arrives, he flips [[Ash's hat|his hat]] backwards, but in the next shot, his hat faces forwards. The following depicts it being backwards again.
* When Ash jumps onto {{TP|Kiawe|Charizard}}, the latter's belly turns blue like its wings for a few frames.

